{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MERGE, EVOLUTION AND AWAKENING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/4a7b79c7cee6a0261b5de5cb32c96b55.poster.avif?t=1769918862\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/4a7b79c7cee6a0261b5de5cb32c96b55.webm?t=1769918862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/4a7b79c7cee6a0261b5de5cb32c96b55.mp4?t=1769918862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities from different elements to create new forms of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken stronger versions of each ability, unlock upgrades, and enhance your attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unprecedented elemental junctions and assemble outrageous combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAT AND INTERACTIVE BROADCAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/b14ea1ed77c586306f72b6f19aec0ccb.poster.avif?t=1769918862\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/b14ea1ed77c586306f72b6f19aec0ccb.webm?t=1769918862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/b14ea1ed77c586306f72b6f19aec0ccb.mp4?t=1769918862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic beings comment on everything you do, live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive proposals, sponsorships, and challenges while the chat reacts in real time to your successes, mistakes, and decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE BUILD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your build, your style, and even what your basic attack is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discard, add, merge, or exchange abilities as you wish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE TOWER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower suddenly appeared in our world and no one knows the reason. People were pulled inside without warning. Luke Trashwalker, the player, a truly pathetic individual, is one of them. Inside, cosmic beings watch humans climb through a system similar to a live broadcast. They call themselves constellations. Ion, your guiding constellation, must lead you to the top where the truth awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to the top of the tower, but remember: You are not the hero. You are the content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/af870c2248f870cd39abc82f76902112.avif?t=1769918862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras_big/af870c2248f870cd39abc82f76902112.webp?t=1769918862 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661580?t=1769918862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661580?t=1769918862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/49f55d3878776eef9130f31c7d08a1771e0fbcc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769918862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/49f55d3878776eef9130f31c7d08a1771e0fbcc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769918862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":