do, live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive proposals, sponsorships, and challenges while the chat reacts in real time to your successes, mistakes, and decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE BUILD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your build, your style, and even what your basic attack is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discard, add, merge, or exchange abilities as you wish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE TOWER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower suddenly appeared in our world and no one knows the reason. People were pulled inside without warning. Luke Trashwalker, the player, a truly pathetic individual, is one of them. Inside, cosmic beings watch humans climb through a system similar to a live broadcast. They call themselves constellations. Ion, your guiding constellation, must lead you to the top where the truth awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to the top of the tower, but remember: You are not the hero. You are the content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras/af870c2248f870cd39abc82f76902112.avif?t=1769918862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/extras_big/af870c2248f870cd39abc82f76902112.webp?t=1769918862 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>","developers":["Required Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/1f94b43d841e9555f8868bafe93f97f2cb5b1b32/header.jpg?t=1769918862","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<st